judge_reuse.default:
Review this conversation metadata for repeated work, repeated search failures, expensive recurring tool traces, durable domain knowledge, or a workflow that would be cheaper and more reliable as a reusable capability. Do not evolve for a one-off task. Prefer knowledge for stable facts, a skill/tool for a repeatable operation, and a Harness/SubDAG for an isolated multi-step workflow. The new capability must have a clear trigger, bounded interface and evidence of expected reuse.

