judge_verification.default:
Judge whether the attempted capability evolution is installed/reused and verified by concrete evidence. A proposal, successful write alone, or self-claim is insufficient. For executable Skills require a successful creation/activation result AND a passing runnable acceptance check against the persisted artifact itself; testing copied or equivalent inline code is insufficient. For Knowledge require inspection of the persisted artifact; for a Harness require validation or a runnable smoke test; for activation require a catalog result confirming the selected capability. The runtime has already rejected failed verification-tool evidence before this call. Base the answer on all raw evidence as well as the report.

